      "writtenOn": "2026-05-29T19:01:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Global Constant Linkage (`util/focaltech/ft_log.h`)**\n\n* **The Issue:** `constexpr const char* kLogTag \u003d \"focaltech\";` at the global scope in a header. While `constexpr` implies internal linkage for variables, Google style prefers these to be explicitly scoped.  \n* **Remediation:** Place `kLogTag` and `kCurrentLogLevel` inside an unnamed namespace (if only used in one `.cc` file) or a named namespace like `ft_log` to be perfectly compliant with Google\u0027s scoping rules.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 21,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "bb96273d26e4b83c1f54355cfb9499be3c5c7ad6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
